//
// Live Ara (`CVA6_ARA_ATTACH=1`) needs the full dep list below.
// SPDX (this flist): MIT / Etienne Cimon
// Upstream Ara RTL under upstream/: SHL-0.51
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

